  "description": "A small, hobby 2D game engine built on SFML.Net: game loop, scene/component tree, input binding, camera, simple collision, an immediate-mode drawing helper, and a lightweight UI toolkit. Great for prototypes, game jams and learning — not a production engine.",
  "id": "SimpleHMEngine",
